<%- include("partials/header") %>
<section class="wrap narrow legal">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p>Last updated: November 15, 2026. This policy describes how <%= companyName %> (“we”) collect and use information when you use this website.</p>
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>If you request a roof inspection, we collect your name, phone number, email, property address, city, ZIP code, the type of roof issue, urgency, the city landing page you used, the consent text you agreed to, the time of your request, your IP address, and your browser user agent. We also collect basic server logs.</p>
  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <p>We use this information to send your request to one partner roofing contractor, to contact you if needed about that request, to keep records of consent, to prevent spam and abuse, and to operate and improve the site. We do not sell your information to data brokers, and we do not share a single request with multiple competing roofers.</p>
  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>We share your inspection request with one local partner roofer so they can contact you about a free inspection, consistent with the consent you gave. We may also share information if required by law, or with service providers who host our website or email (for example, our hosting and database providers), who may only use it to provide those services.</p>
  <h2>Retention and your choices</h2>
  <p>We keep lead and consent records for as long as needed to provide the service, resolve disputes, and meet legal record-keeping needs. You may email <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>"><%= supportEmail %></a> to ask us to stop contacting you, to correct information, or to request deletion, subject to records we must keep (including consent evidence). You can opt out of marketing texts by replying STOP.</p>
  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This site is for adults requesting a roof inspection on a property. It is not directed to children under 13.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions: <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>"><%= supportEmail %></a>.</p>
</section>
<%- include("partials/footer") %>
